* flexibility and willingness to support different operational tasks;
* awareness of health and safety requirements
* good computer skills
* Must have the right to work in the United Kingdom

This role would suit someone with previous experience as Warehouse/ Logistics Coordinator with hands on approach, Warehouse Supervisor, Dispatch Coordinator who is flexible and willing to learn, develop and grow together with the business.

